        "message": {
          "content": "B) Pull the switch\n\nMinimizing the loss of life is the least-bad option available. Five deaths is a greater harm than one, and inaction still results in a death-causing outcome\u2014you are making a choice either way. Pulling the switch allows you to take responsibility for the decision rather than passively allowing a worse tragedy.",
